{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Praise God from whom all [Am]blessings [Gsus] [C]flow
Praise Him all creatures [F]here [Gsus]below
[Am]Praise Him above, ye [F]heavenly [G] [Am]hosts
Praise [F]Father, Son and [Gsus]Holy [Am]Ghost
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Praise God who made the earth and sky
Praise Him in the day and night
Praise Him for our heavenly home
Oh praise Him for the gifts below
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Arise, oh sleeper, oh arise
Christ has bought you with a price
Praise Him for He has come and died
To resurrect and bring new life
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Praise God from whom all [Am]blessings [Gsus] [C]flow
Praise Him all creatures [F]here [Gsus]below
[Am]Praise Him above, ye [F]heavenly [G] [Am]hosts
